<header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="eyebrow">The Lab</div><h1>Where the business gets stronger underneath.</h1><p>XGL works across growth, operations, customer experience, CRM, automation, risk, positioning, and founder load. The point is not to install more tools. The point is to make the company easier to run, easier to trust, and harder to break.</p></div></header>
